
# POST API Requests

## Overview

This document provides examples of **POST API requests** for manual API testing. These requests are used to create new resources such as users, products, and reviews.

Each example includes the HTTP method, endpoint, required headers, request body, expected response status, response body, and relevant validation scenarios.

